# The point that corresponds to the 6.4.1 hold point lies inside the critical section here, so a hold there would
# keep the lock that the new task's GetAppID needs (C5 A6).  Declared lock-held: the runtime refuses it unless a plan
# point says ALLOW_LOCK_HELD (event_semantics.md section 7).  Draft: no plan uses it.
control 5 ctx=lock-held ref="cfe_es_apps.c:571 lock, 669 unlock" note="C5 A6: the fixed code holds the lock here"

